  "summary": "Malicious code in @servicetitan/examples (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases and uses it to execute a heavily obfuscated 727KB payload (math_init.js) at install time. The payload is obfuscated with javascript-obfuscator (thousands of _0x-prefixed identifiers, eval, child_process references) to hide its behaviour. The package also depends on 17 sibling @servicetitan/* packages that are known malware. The dist/bundle/ directory contains legitimate ServiceTitan UI component examples as cover content.",
